10. Q10: Two activities (City Walking Tour, Science Museum for Kids) and one restaurant (Italian Trattoria) were booked. The counts are 2 and 1 respectively.
11. Q11: The user had a maximum budget of €1700. The total cost of the package is €1220. The remaining budget is €1700 - €1220 = €480.

